  "detailed_description": "The “Farmers Interest Group (FIG)” scheme, by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, supports every group of 15 farmers with grants for agricultural development. The scheme offers financial assistance for purchasing office equipment, training, ID cards, and district-level meetings.\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The beneficiary should be a Farmer.\n  - The beneficiary should be a resident of Tamil Nadu.\n  - The beneficiary should be part of a Farmer’s group of 15 farmers.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
